  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (ja): コハコベ",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%B3%E3%83%8F%E3%82%B3%E3%83%99",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 109475758,
      "text": "コハコベ は、ナデシコ科ハコベ属の越年草。単にハコベともよばれている。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Stellaria media",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stellaria_media",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1367518259,
      "text": "Stellaria media, chickweed, is an annual flowering plant in the family Caryophyllaceae. It is native to Eurasia and naturalized throughout the world, where it is a weed of waste ground, farmland and gardens. It is sometimes grown as a salad crop or for poultry consumption."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Stellaria media",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stellaria_media",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 175370078,
      "text": "Stellaria media, el capiquí, álsine, pamplina o hierba gallinera, es una especie de planta herbácea anual del género Stellaria de la familia Caryophyllaceae nativa de Europa."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Stellaria media",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stellaria_media",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 229132059,
      "text": "La Stellaire intermédiaire, également appelée le Mouron blanc ou la Morgeline, est une espèce de plantes à fleurs de la famille des Caryophyllaceae. C'est une plante herbacée annuelle, bisannuelle ou vivace commune en Europe et dans une grande partie de l'hémisphère nord. Elle peut faire office de plante bioindicatrice car sa présence est la signature d'un sol équilibré et fertile."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Morugem",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Morugem",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 70152596,
      "text": "A morugem, também conhecida como erva-estrela, morugem-branca, morugem-verdadeira, esparguta, erva-pontiaguda, morugem vulgar ou merugem, pertence à família das Caryophyllaceae."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Jukut piyik",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jukut_piyik",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29736803,
      "text": "Stellaria media, jukut piyik, merupakan tanaman berbunga tahunan dalam keluarga Caryophyllaceae. Tanaman ini berasal dari Eurasia dan dinaturalisasikan di seluruh dunia, di mana ia merupakan tanaman liar di lahan limbah, lahan pertanian, dan kebun. Kadang-kadang ditanam sebagai tanaman salad atau untuk konsumsi unggas."
    }
  },
